@MoneyManager_HostAddress = http://localhost:5224

### 1. Create a New Category
POST {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/category
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Food"
}

### 2. Get Category By ID (Valid ID)
GET {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/category/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Category By ID (Invalid / Non-existent ID)
GET {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/category/999
Accept: application/json

### 4. Delete Category (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/category/1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get All Active Categories
GET {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/category
Accept: application/json

### 6. Update Category
PUT {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/category/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title" : "food"
}


### EXPENSES ENDPOINTS

### 1. Create a New Expense (With Category)
POST {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/expense
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": 150.50,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### 2. Create a New Expense (Without Category - Nullable check)
POST {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/expense
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": 45.00
}

### 3. Create a New Expense (Invalid Category ID - Should Fail 400/404)
POST {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/expense
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": 200.00,
  "categoryId": 999
}

### 4. Create a New Expense (Invalid Amount - Validation Fail)
POST {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/expense
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": -10.00,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### 5. Patch (Partial Update) - Only Amount
PATCH {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/expense/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "amount": 180.00
}

### 6. Patch (Partial Update) - Only Category
PATCH {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/expense/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 2
}

### 7. Delete Expense (Hard Delete)
DELETE {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/expense/2
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Expenses - Page 1 with Size 2
GET {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/expense?pageNumber=1&pageSize=2
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Expenses - Page 2 with Size 2
GET {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/expense?pageNumber=2&pageSize=2
Accept: application/json


### Auth Endpoints
### 1. Register New User
POST {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Register Duplicate User (Should Return BadRequest - Email taken)
POST {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Login with Correct Credentials
POST {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Login with Wrong Password (Should Fail)
POST {{MoneyManager_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}
